SUMMARY:Wine Afternoon at Marked Tree Vineyard — Introverts Edition
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\n🍇 Cross-posted with Asheville Transpl
 ants group\n**New to Asheville and haven't explored the local wine scene y
 et? Same. Let's fix that — over a glass at Marked Tree Vineyard.**\nWe'r
 e spending a relaxed Saturday afternoon at Marked Tree Vineyard\, one of t
 he prettiest spots in the area — sweeping mountain views\, a great pour 
 list\, and plenty of room to spread out and chat. It's about a 30-minute s
 cenic drive from Asheville\, in Flat Rock\, NC.\nThis is low-key\, no pres
 sure — just a group of introverts who'd rather share a glass of wine wit
 h new friends than scroll Netflix alone on a Saturday. Whether you're a wi
 ne snob or a "I'll have whatever's good" person\, you belong here.\n**The 
 Plan:**\n• 1:00 PM — Meet at Marked Tree Vineyard\n• 1:00–4:00 PM 
 — Tastings\, lounging\, and conversation on the patio\n**What to Know:**
 \n• Tasting fees are on your own (typically around $10–20)\n• Drivin
 g required — Marked Tree is about 30 min from downtown Asheville\n• Do
 g-friendly on the patio (worth a quick call ahead if you're bringing one)\
 n• Light bites are usually available on-site\, or grab a late lunch on t
 he way back\nSpace is limited to 20 so we can actually get to know each ot
 her. Grab your spot!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/314507057
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260427T135716Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260427T135716Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
