SUMMARY:NBA Finals Game 2: Casual Watch Meetup
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nJoin us at Asheville Sports Club to watc
 h **Game 2 of the NBA Finals** in a relaxed\, low-key setting with fellow 
 fans.\n\nThis isn’t your typical high-energy sports bar crowd—we’re 
 aiming for a **comfortable\, easygoing watch experience** where people can
  enjoy the game\, chat a bit\, and just take it in without over-the-top in
 tensity.\n\nFeel free to **stay for as long or as little as you’d like**
 —whether that’s 15 minutes or the full game.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/314786695
 /
